    """`pow(v, -0.5)` where the others write `rsqrt(v)` (HF `Gemma4RMSNorm._norm`).

    Gemma 4 spells the reciprocal square root as `torch.pow(..., -0.5)` to keep
    Torch and JAX in agreement, and -- unlike Gemma 1-3 -- its weight is *not*
